    "sub_name": "智能化數位行銷",
    "sub_ename": "AI DIGITAL MARKETING",
    "describe_ch": "目前市場上數位行銷的理論說明，並透過數據分析與商業分析來說明實際案例。\n\n瞭解AI大數據在搜尋引擎上的行銷應用，與利用AI來做為客戶服務的案例分析。",
    "describe_eh": "The current theoretical description of digital marketing on the market, and through the data analysis and business analysis to illustrate the actual case.\n\nLearn about AI Big Data's marketing applications on search engines and case studies using AI as a customer service.",
