  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "CB26119",
    "sub_id": "48863",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>20% 出席與課堂參與(包含踴躍發問與回答問題)&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>20%&nbsp;Attend and participate in class (including actively asking and answering questions)</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>20% 平時課程作業繳交</div>\n\n<div>20%&nbsp;Coursework Submission</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>30% 期中品牌實作與報告(會根據課程進度來出行銷期中考作業題目)</div>\n\n<div>30%&nbsp;Midterm exam brand practice and report (marketing midterm exam homework questions will be determined according to course progress)</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>30% 期末考品牌實際操作與報告(會根據整個課程有教過的來出期末行銷作業題目)</div>\n\n<div>30%Final exam brand practical operation and report (final marketing assignment questions will be based on what has been taught throughout the course)</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "本課程大多討論與教學目前業界數位行銷做法與技巧，與AI行銷應用於商業行銷案例說明，請同學上課認真學習，作業按時繳交 ，勇於發問，遵守上課禮儀\nThis course primarily discusses and teaches current digital marketing practices and techniques in the industry, along with case studies illustrating the application of AI marketing in business marketing. Students are expected to pay close attention in class, submit assignments on time, ask questions, and observe classroom etiquette.",
    "course_pol_en": "本課程大多討論與教學目前業界數位行銷做法與技巧，請同學上課認真學習，作業按時繳交 ，勇於發問，遵守上課禮儀\nThis course mostly discusses and teaches the current digital marketing practices and techniques in the industry. Students are asked to study carefully in class, submit assignments on time, be brave enough to ask questions, and abide by class etiquette.",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>期望對於數位行銷有興趣的同學，能在課堂上多提出問題&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>因為課堂很多的目前正在執行數位行銷的廠商品牌範例也希望同學不可在外討論與洩漏敏感資訊</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Students who are interested in digital marketing are encouraged to actively participate in class and ask more questions. Since the course content includes real-world cases from companies and brands currently implementing digital marketing strategies, students are reminded not to discuss or disclose any sensitive business information outside the classroom.</div>\n\n<div>期望對數位行銷有興趣的同學，能在課堂上積極發言並提出更多問題。由於課堂內容包含許多目前實際執行數位行銷的企業與品牌案例，因此也特別提醒同學們，請勿在課堂外進行討論或洩漏任何涉及敏感商業資訊的內容。</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
